#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0242 expect=skipped domain=ADSL
#note "TRT01AN, the operator's TARGET and the rule's single Requirements.Variables.All entry, is absent. TRTxxA seeds tuple xx=01 and TRTxxAN is synthesised as the absent TRT01AN; the expansion rewrites Requirements.Variables.All to ['TRT01AN'], which is absent, so the rule is reported not executed with the Requirements.Variables reason -- converting what would otherwise be a silent EC-53 no-op into an auditable row naming the variable. The shipped PMDA-AD0242B sibling fixture is the identical shape and is green."
#library standard=adamig version=1-0
dataset ADSL
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col TRT01A  type=Char
---
S1 | 001 | DRUGX
S1 | 002 | PLACEBO
